          "text": "To remember all the questions you have when you are not in the doctor’s office, write them down and bring the list with you to your appointment.",
          "source": {
            "paperId": "paper-gaokao-2020-ii",
            "paperTitle": "2020年普通高等学校招生全国统一考试（新高考Ⅱ）英语试题",
