          }
        },
        {
          "exampleId": "w:appointment#e-4006b11472f1720e",
          "text": "“People started queuing to make an appointment early in the morning,” says Emile Ducke, a German photographer who traveled with the staff of the Saint Lukas for a two-week trip in November through the vast regions（区域）of Krasnoyarsk and Khakassia.",
